    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        562.1995849609375,
        393.2210388183594,
        574.1995849609375
      ],
      "text": "The terms “conversion” and “reversion” of culture as used here are defined as follows: b",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.35698699951172,
        574.015625,
        512.5092163085938,
        587.6236572265625
      ],
      "text": "Conversion (to negative):  culture is considered to have converted to negative when two consecutive cultures, taken at",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21299743652344,
        584.3995971679688,
        512.525146484375,
        596.3995971679688
      ],
      "text": "least 30 days apart, are found to be negative. In such a case, the specimen collection date of the first negative culture is",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21299743652344,
        593.9995727539062,
        209.61297607421875,
        605.9995727539062
      ],
      "text": "used as the date of conversion.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        94.35698699951172,
        605.8156127929688,
        512.4371337890625,
        619.4236450195312
      ],
      "text": "Reversion (to positive):  culture is considered to have reverted to positive when, after an initial conversion, two",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21299743652344,
        616.1996459960938,
        512.4610595703125,
        628.1996459960938
      ],
      "text": "consecutive cultures, taken at least 30 days apart, are found to be positive. For the purpose of defining  ,  Treatment failed",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.2130126953125,
        626.9996337890625,
        339.86907958984375,
        638.9996337890625
      ],
